-- NOT APPLIED. This package deliberately has no executable rollback.
--
-- Moving owner links increments Personal Plan source revisions and drafts have
-- monotonic revisions. A later inverse cannot restore those values faithfully
-- from the privacy-safe one-off evidence alone. If the merge causes a verified
-- defect, stop and create a fresh, reviewed compensating-recovery plan from a
-- new read-only snapshot. Do not edit this file into an inverse operator.
BEGIN;
DO $recovery$
BEGIN
  RAISE EXCEPTION 'OGX merge has no automatic rollback; create a fresh compensating recovery plan' USING ERRCODE = '22000';
END
$recovery$;
ROLLBACK;
